## Interface: 16001
## Title: Velocity Self Buff Highlights
## Notes: Glows the action button of a self-buff while it is missing (Thorns, Mark of the Wild, seals...), and mirrors melee / ranged auto-attack state onto the macro buttons you choose. Works in combat on WoW Forever.
